---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | CalcPath"
  description="CalcPath terms of use. Our calculators provide estimates, not financial advice. Use at your own risk."
>
  <div class="max-w-[768px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-2">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-500 mb-8">Last updated: February 2026</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Calculator Accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          Results are estimates based on the inputs you provide and standard financial formulas.
          Actual results may vary based on factors not captured by the calculator (fees, taxes,
          market conditions, etc.). We test our math rigorously but cannot guarantee accuracy for
          your specific situation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Not Financial Advice</h2>
        <p>
          CalcPath is an educational tool, not a financial advisor. We don't know your full financial
          picture, risk tolerance, or personal circumstances. Our calculators help you understand
          financial concepts and run scenarios — they do not constitute personalized financial advice.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          For decisions about investments, loans, retirement planning, or other financial matters,
          consult a qualified financial advisor.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Use at Your Own Risk</h2>
        <p>
          CalcPath provides its tools "as is" without warranties of any kind. We are not liable for
          any decisions made or actions taken based on calculator results. You are solely responsible
          for verifying the accuracy of any calculations before making financial decisions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          Calculator code, educational content, and design are copyrighted &copy; 2026 CalcPath.
          Embeddable calculator widgets are provided for use on third-party sites with required
          attribution ("Powered by CalcPath" with a link back to calcpath.pages.dev).
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          CalcPath contains links to third-party websites and financial products. We are not
          responsible for the content, privacy policies, or practices of these external sites. See
          our <a href="/disclosure" class="text-primary-500 hover:text-primary-700 underline">affiliate disclosure</a> for
          details about our affiliate relationships.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 mb-3">Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top reflects
          the most recent revision. Continued use of CalcPath after changes constitutes acceptance
          of the updated terms.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
